oad/M2.5/manifest.json"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/releases/assets/614176084","id":614176084,"node_id":"RA_kwDOS0ubjc4km5VU","name":"manifest.sig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"dvucinozd","id":58355393,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MzU1Mzkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58355393?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd","html_url":"https://github.com/dvucinozd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dvucinozd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":64,"digest":"sha256:fe49ac6c3597add921107f1f026cb8e6352f95392d1a59002d2b95e9341a2c42","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-10-06T02:05:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T02:05:03Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/releases/download/M2.5/manifest.sig"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/tarball/M2.5","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/zipball/M2.5","body":"M2.5 is released for **JC4880 / Pioneer DDJ-FLX4 / PCM5102A MAIN / FLX4 headphone cue**.\n\n- Retains the previous product UI and adds the supplied Pajoniiir logo when track artwork is missing, in Library and Overview.\n- Consolidates the shared-core library/transport work already published in v91: richer metadata, playlists/artwork, memory cues, persistent cue edits, title/downbeat corrections and improved seek/loop handling.\n- Keeps S3CP v2/v3 compatibility and v4 profiles, signed board-specific OTA and bounded startup readiness.\n\nThanks to collaborator **[kayrozen](https://github.com/kayrozen)** for modules, fixes and ideas adapted from his Pajoniiir fork, including metadata, seek/cue/loop, JC1060/DDJ-400 and Pro DJ Link work. Provenance and licensing remain in [the integration ledger](https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/blob/M2.5/docs/FORK_IMPROVEMENTS.md).\n\nThe artwork candidate passed signed OTA, normal USB/media return, cover/logo/page transitions, allocation/resource checks and operator-confirmed MAIN/D1/D2 cue listening with zero new strict faults. Final tagged-image results and artifact hashes are recorded in the release evidence.\n\n**Explicit release exception:** the operator waived a new 180-minute soak for this final M2.5 image because audio/deck/DSP code is unchanged. The final image receives short OTA/startup/USB/UI/audio checks; v91's older soak remains evidence for v91, and no M2.5 long-soak PASS is claimed.\n\nJC1060/DDJ-400/real Pro DJ Link peers remain development configurations awaiting hardware acceptance. Recorder/SD experiments are disabled; APTA and the public Web Profile Builder v4 deployment are separate. Full real-export/downbeat/PWV4 comparison, nested playlist order, source-cue reimport/restore/cross-media isolation, delayed/corrupt artwork and advanced active-removal/shift/touch variants remain unrun.\n\nApp-only OTA preserves the partition layout. Previous immutable releases remain available for signed service rollback.\n\nRead the [user manual](https://docs.pajoniiir.eu/) and [release record](https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/blob/master/docs/validation/M2_5_RELEASE_20261006.md).\n\nFrozen source: `20f1c3f04a615209ae25e9bbdae649d0f5b44e8d`, annotated tag `M2.5`, ESP-IDF 6.0.2. [Exact-source CI](https://github.com/dvucinozd/Pajoniiir/actions/runs/37401972853).\n\nArtifacts:\n- `main-deck-p4.bin`: 2,576,432 bytes, SHA-256 `7aaab31d4a7c00990939cb9ccecb04aba1cba463b1db919d168477c7df3210ba`.\n- `main-deck-p4.ddjota`: 2,576,620 bytes, SHA-256 `44db191c1785168781e9b2893cac6dda1b92a20a5342c328d7fbfdbbd8707e27`.\n- `manifest.json` and `manifest.sig`: independently verified signed release manifest.\n\nFinal tagged M2.5 / ota_1 passed signed OTA and startup readiness, USB storage/FLX4 availability and 62.622211 seconds of measured dual playback with zero new strict PCM, deadline, USB packet/ring/host/queue faults. The operator confirmed normal Overview and clean MAIN/D1/D2 CUE sound. Both decks were stopped at completion. All eight exact-source CI jobs passed.\r\n"}